# Normalise line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform, so the
# Windows CI runner (which defaults core.autocrlf=true) checks text out as LF.
# Line-based tests then read the same bytes everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
